   <details class="mnav"><summary aria-label="Open menu"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16"/></svg><span>Menu</span></summary><div class="mpanel">
    <p class="mh">Students</p><a class="mt hero" href="/app#signup" data-cta="menu"><b>Create your free account</b><small>Free for every nursing student</small></a><a class="mt" href="/free-nclex-practice-exam"><b>NCLEX practice exam</b><small>85 to 150 adaptive items</small></a><a class="mt" href="/nclex-practice-questions"><b>Practice questions</b><small>All 8 NCLEX categories</small></a><a class="mt" href="/next-generation-nclex"><b>Next Generation NCLEX</b><small>Item types and case studies</small></a><a class="mt" href="/nclex-prioritization-questions"><b>Prioritization and delegation</b><small>Who first, who can do what</small></a><a class="mt" href="/nclex-dosage-calculation-practice"><b>Dosage calculation</b><small>Worked solutions</small></a><a class="mt" href="/nclex-lab-values"><b>Lab values</b><small>Normal ranges</small></a><a class="mt" href="/nclex-study-guides"><b>Study library</b><small>Free printable guides</small></a>
    <p class="mh">Nursing programs</p><a class="mt hero" href="/for-nursing-schools"><b>Vexcura for nursing schools</b><small>Pricing, pilots and program tools</small></a><a class="mt" href="/academic-ehr-for-nursing-students"><b>Academic EHR</b><small>Epic-style charting practice</small></a><a class="mt" href="/nursing-simulation-scenarios"><b>Simulation</b><small>Drills, telemetry, megacodes</small></a><a class="mt" href="/software"><b>Our software</b><small>The whole platform</small></a>
    <p class="mh">Vexcura</p><a class="mt" href="/about"><b>About</b><small>Who built it, and why</small></a><a class="mt" href="/app#signin"><b>Sign in</b><small>Already have an account</small></a>
   </div></details></nav></div></header><script>(function(){var d=document.querySelector(".mnav");if(!d)return;document.addEventListener("click",function(e){if(d.open&&!d.contains(e.target))d.open=false});document.addEventListener("keydown",function(e){if(e.key==="Escape"&&d.open){d.open=false;d.querySelector("summary").focus()}})})();</script><main><nav class="crumb w" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> › <span>About</span></nav><section class="hero w"><h1>About Vexcura</h1><p class="lead">Vexcura was founded by Tyler Savage, RN, CRS, LNC, a registered nurse with more than a decade at the bedside in medical-surgical, step-down, long-term acute care, and rehabilitation units, including charge nurse, house supervisor, code team, and rapid response work.</p><div class="cta"><a class="btn" href="/for-nursing-schools">Vexcura for nursing schools</a><a class="btn alt" href="/nclex-practice-questions">Browse practice questions</a></div></section><div class="w"><h2 id="founder">Meet the founder</h2><div class="fnd"><div class="fndi" aria-hidden="true">TS</div><div><p class="fndn"><b>Tyler Savage, RN, CRS, LNC</b><span>Founder</span></p><p>Tyler Savage is a registered nurse with more than a decade in nursing across medical-surgical, step-down, long-term acute care, and inpatient rehabilitation units in Georgia and Tennessee, including travel assignments at community hospitals and an academic medical center. He has worked as a charge nurse, house supervisor, preceptor, and unit safety officer, and has served on code and rapid response teams. He has charted in Epic, Cerner (Oracle Health), MEDITECH, and ProTouch, which is why Vexcura's practice EHR teaches habits that carry over to any system instead of copying one vendor's screens. He is also a Clinical Reimbursement Specialist (CRS) and Legal Nurse Consultant (LNC), holds ACLS, BLS, and NIH Stroke Scale certifications, and earned his nursing degree at Chattanooga State Community College. A patient nominated him for the DAISY Award for Extraordinary Nurses. He lives in Ringgold, Georgia.</p><ul class="fndc"><li>DAISY Award nominee (nominated by a patient)</li><li>More than 10 years in nursing</li><li>Charge nurse, house supervisor, preceptor</li><li>Code team and rapid response</li><li>Epic, Cerner, MEDITECH, ProTouch</li><li>ACLS, BLS, NIHSS</li></ul></div></div>
     <h2>Why it exists</h2><p>Nursing faculty juggle NCLEX readiness, clinical paperwork, EHR practice and simulation across separate tools, and students often meet a real EHR for the first time on a clinical day. Vexcura puts that work in one place: NCLEX-RN practice and adaptive exams, an Epic-style academic EHR, and a workspace for clinical instructors with attendance, badge sign-in, assignments and curriculum. <a href="/for-nursing-schools">See how programs use it</a>.</p>
     <h2>How Vexcura is licensed</h2><p>Vexcura is licensed to nursing schools and healthcare facilities. Students and instructors are always free; the school or facility pays, every plan includes every feature, and licenses are paid by check. Tyler is the representative for every program and handles major customizations personally. <a href="/for-nursing-schools#pricing">See pricing</a> or call <a href="tel:+17626772802">762-677-2802</a>.</p>
     <h2>What makes it different</h2><ul><li>Questions are cited to current guidelines, drug labels, and nursing texts, and each one is fact-checked separately before it's published.</li><li>Simulations come from real clinical experience: patients who change in real time, an electronic chart, and megacodes run against current resuscitation guidelines.</li><li>The exam stops by the same rules as the NCLEX, so your practice feels like test day.</li><li>The founder answers the phone. Programs work directly with the person who built it.</li></ul>
     <h2>Independence</h2><p>Vexcura is not affiliated with NCSBN, Pearson VUE, ATI, or any nursing school. Questions are original practice items written to the published test plan. Questions are written and fact-checked with AI assistance and reviewed against published sources. <a href="/app#editorial">See how questions are checked</a>.</p><h2>Related</h2><ul class="rel"><li><a href="/for-nursing-schools">Vexcura for nursing schools</a></li><li><a href="/free-nclex-practice-exam">Full adaptive NCLEX-RN practice exam</a></li><li><a href="/academic-ehr-for-nursing-students">Epic-style academic EHR</a></li><li><a href="/academic-ehr-comparison">Academic EHR comparison (SimChart, EHR Go, DocuCare)</a></li><li><a href="/software">The Vexcura platform</a></li></ul></div><section class="band vxs-band"><div class="vxs-bg" data-vxs-i="0" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="vxs-sh" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="w"><h2>Free for every nursing student</h2><p>Create an account and get the full adaptive NCLEX-RN practice exam, 2,400+ cited questions, 8 NGN case studies, the Epic-style academic EHR and the simulations, with or without a school. Nursing programs license Vexcura for their cohorts and faculty, and every plan includes everything.</p><div class="cta"><a class="btn" href="/app#signup" data-cta="band">Create your free account</a><a class="btn alt" href="/for-nursing-schools">For nursing schools</a></div></div></section></main><footer class="foot mktf"><div class="w">
